      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-12-29T12:17:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No.  When a player is stated they cannot draw cards, they cannot draw cards.  It has nothing to do with simply negating the draw phase; it simply does not allow card draws.  Any action that would allow a card to be drawn, including but not limited to the draw phase, is cancelled.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:58:53.279Z",
